\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset ERT
status open

\begin_layout Plain Layout


\backslash
begin{verbatim}
\end_layout

\begin_layout Plain Layout

/controller/move/ 60 0.75 
\begin_inset Quotes eld
\end_inset

legato
\begin_inset Quotes erd
\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Plain Layout


\backslash
end{verbatim}
\end_layout

\end_inset

Messages must also also include the a tag that stipulates the data types being used.
 So for the message above,
 we need:
